---
description: Compose a reproducible dossier and source-revision checkpoint.
args: { request:CommissionRequest; sources:ArchiveSource[]; observations:SearchObservation[]; searchCoverage:ArchiveSearchCoverage[]; leads:FollowupLead[]; claims:SupportedClaim[]; checkpoint:ResearchCheckpoint; sourceBlockers:string[] }
returns: CommissionDossier
---
For every question state the supported finding or unresolved disposition. Return searchCoverage as the per-collection/per-question source-bound account, including query variants and exact observation IDs. Distinguish observed hits, observed no-hits, closed/restricted, partial and not-searched; do not call a not-searched scope exhausted. Preserve citations, source revisions, interpretation notes, rights restrictions and remaining leads. Do not reproduce restricted material; offer its authorized citation or description. Carry each sourceBlocker verbatim into coverageLimits and status incomplete; do not imply the scope was source-validated. Return a checkpoint that reopens only claims dependent on changed source revisions. Set extension-needed when a valuable open lead exceeds remaining effort and no source blocker makes the commission incomplete; set incomplete whenever scope-binding evidence is missing.
